    "People who cycle or walk to work in the city centre often find Armley's canal route the more pleasant daily journey, while football fans and those working in south Leeds or at the White Rose office park often prefer Beeston. In both, the condition of individual houses varies enormously, so choosing the right street and landlord matters more than the neighbourhood name.",
