    "Burley is slightly more expensive than Kirkstall. It has Burley Park station, with trains to Leeds in around five minutes, and converted mills and apartment blocks that appeal to young professionals. Its main road is a busy retail and leisure corridor, and it still has a significant student population near Hyde Park.",
