    "Meanwood is built around a wooded valley, with Meanwood Park, the Hollies and the Meanwood Valley Trail leading north towards Golden Acre Park and beyond. It has a small parade of independent shops and pubs, low crime and a strong family atmosphere, but little nightlife and steep streets. Its houses are more often let whole, so couples and families have more choice here than in Chapel Allerton's divided villas.",
