    "Hebden Bridge has a remarkable independent and creative culture, with independent shops, cafés, a cinema, the Trades Club music venue and a strong LGBTQ+ community. Hardcastle Crags, Heptonstall and Stoodley Pike are on its doorstep. Rents are the highest in Calderdale, and the town has suffered repeated serious flooding.",
